    Add debug ports to multinode config (#7893)
    
    This PR adds debug ports (5005, 5006, 5007) to the various nodes running
    in the multi node test config. Makes zero difference to the GHA use, but
    if you're using that script to test locally it can be handy to be able
    to get into the JVMs with a debugger.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Run the script, then start admin, worker, and presentation to make sure
    each one is listening on its port
    
